    "Active send shows a sending status instead of a generic local-record read status"
  ],
  "cases": [
    "Abort while awaiting thread/start yields failed/CANCELLED and no queue request",
    "Abort after queue attempt yields unknown/HANDOFF_UNKNOWN; exactly one attempt remains",
    "Both branches release native connections and in-flight guard; subsequent explicit preview/send succeeds",
    "Batch cancellation after first queue leaves first unknown and second failed/CANCELLED without starting second project",
    "Dialog close or page departure exits fixture transport processes before delayed reply; reopening never sends automatically"
  ],
  "testRepairs": [
    "Initial actual browser run exposed Escape closing both nested dialogs; corrected event ownership and reran",
    "Final status selector initially matched an empty status in the outer drawer; narrowed it to the closest handoff dialog"
  ],
